      "source": [
        "# P19 ClaimIQ - Week 4: Bronze Ingestion\n",
        "\n",
        "**Project:** P19 ClaimIQ\n",
        "\n",
        "**Week:** 4\n",
        "\n",
        "Goal: Preserve raw ClaimIQ records with ingestion metadata, create Bronze Delta tables, and reconcile source and Bronze row counts.\n",
        "\n",
        "Approved sources: claims.parquet, policies.json, policyholders.csv, products.csv, providers.csv, claim_payments.csv.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%sql\n",
        "USE CATALOG workspace;\n",
        "USE SCHEMA default;\n",
        "\n",
        "SELECT\n",
        "  current_catalog() AS active_catalog,\n",
        "  current_schema() AS active_schema;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%fs\n",
        "ls /Volumes/workspace/default/claimiq"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Bronze Metadata Contract\n",
        "\n",
        "Every Bronze table preserves the original business values and adds technical metadata.\n",
        "\n",
        "Metadata columns:\n",
        "- _source_file_name\n",
        "- _source_file_path\n",
        "- _ingested_at\n",
        "- _ingestion_run_id\n",
        "- _schema_version\n",
        "- _record_hash\n",
        "- _rescued_payload\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%sql\n",
        "CREATE OR REPLACE TEMP VIEW week4_run_control AS\n",
        "SELECT\n",
        "  'W04_CLAIMIQ_RUN01' AS ingestion_run_id,\n",
        "  'claimiq_source_v1.0' AS schema_version;\n",
        "\n",
        "SELECT * FROM week4_run_control;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. Claims Bronze Ingestion\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: claims.parquet\n",
        "\n",
        "Target: bronze_claimiq_claims\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%sql\n",
        "CREATE OR REPLACE TEMP VIEW claims_source\n",
        "USING PARQUET\n",
        "OPTIONS (\n",
        "  path '/Volumes/workspace/default/claimiq/claims.parquet'\n",
        ");\n",
        "\n",
        "SELECT * FROM claims_source LIMIT 10;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%sql\n",
        "CREATE OR REPLACE TEMP VIEW claims_bronze_ready AS\n",
        "SELECT\n",
        "  c.*,\n",
        "  'claims.parquet' AS _source_file_name,\n",
        "  '/Volumes/workspace/default/claimiq/claims.parquet' AS _source_file_path,\n",
        "  current_timestamp() AS _ingested_at,\n",
        "  r.ingestion_run_id AS _ingestion_run_id,\n",
        "  r.schema_version AS _schema_version,\n",
        "  sha2(concat_ws('||',\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.source_record_id AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.claim_id AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.policy_id AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.policyholder_id AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.product_id AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.provider_id AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.claim_type AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.loss_category AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n        "    coalesce(c.loss_date AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.submission_timestamp AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.review_timestamp AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.decision_timestamp AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.settlement_timestamp AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.closure_timestamp AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.claim_status AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.outcome_code AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.requested_amount AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.approved_amount AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.reserve_amount AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.deductible_amount AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.currency_code AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.risk_band AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(cast(c.review_flag AS STRING), '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.exception_code AS STRING, '<NULL>'),\n",
        "    coalesce(c.source_system AS STRING, '<NULL>')\n",
        "  ), 256) AS _record_hash,\n",
        "  CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS _rescued_payload\n",
        "FROM claims_source c\n",
        "CROSS JOIN week4_run_control r;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%sql\n",
        "CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE bronze_claimiq_claims\n",
        "USING DELTA\n",
        "AS\n",
        "SELECT * FROM claims_bronze_ready;\n",
        "\n",
        "SELECT\n",
        "  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM claims_source) AS source_count,\n",
        "  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM bronze_claimiq_claims) AS bronze_count,\n",
        "  CASE\n",
        "    WHEN (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM claims_source) =\n",
        "         (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM bronze_claimiq_claims)\n",
        "    THEN 'PASS'\n",
        "    ELSE 'INVESTIGATE'\n",
        "  END AS reconciliation_status;"
      ]
    },

    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
